#: src/terminal-options.cc:892
#, c-format
msgid "Cannot pass FD %d twice"
msgstr "ᱵᱟᱨ ᱫᱷᱟᱣ FD %d ᱵᱟᱝ ᱯᱟᱥ ᱫᱟᱲᱮᱭᱟᱜᱼᱟ"

